What we changed or added (everything is in the creatures/ folder; the upstream package is not modified):
- creature/            the MotionBricks recipe for any skeleton: skeleton spec JSON, features for N joints and C contacts,
                       an FSQ tokenizer per body plan, a small masked pose transformer, a root net, foot-skate losses, a capsule collision
                       metric and repair, a runtime simulator, eval scripts, an ONNX exporter.
- bodyplans/           the dog (quadruped) and spider body plans: skeleton specs, data scripts, a spider gait generator.
- distill/             scripts that make the NVIDIA human model smaller (layer pick, distillation, quantization, gate).
- runtime/             a C++ runtime with a C API and a Godot GDExtension (ONNX Runtime, CPU).
- sandboxes/           a Godot project that drives a creature with the keyboard.
- models/spider_v3/    spider weights (ONNX). Data attribution: bodyplans/spider/ATTRIBUTION.md.

Third-party data, tools and libraries: see THIRD_PARTY.md.
